      <title>Purgatory and Life</title>
      <link>https://www.franciscanmedia.org/ask-a-franciscan/purgatory-and-life/</link>
      <description>I read somewhere a theory that after death we live our lives over again to see the sins we committed, the people we hurt, and that impact on others. At my advanced age, I am constantly recalling various times in my life where I hurt others (in no criminal or unlawful way).</description>
